Changes: XboxState is local, the adapter exposes the first successful raw
packet, unused packet metadata is omitted, and the
platform tests and formatting follow this workspace. No game data is included.

The pinned skate-host InputFrame has private samples and only public controller()
and buttons() accessors. This adapter reuses its platform mechanism, not Bevy or
a reconstructed gamepad backend. Skate 3 retains its native InputFrame pipeline
because Session::collect cannot accept external samples; Session::tick is a
single-tick diagnostic API, not its variable-frame collect/advance path.
